@EmployeeApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login (get JWT token)
# @name login
POST {{EmployeeApi_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

### List all employees (requires JWT)
GET {{EmployeeApi_HostAddress}}/api/Employee
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Employee salaries for id 1
GET {{EmployeeApi_HostAddress}}/api/Employee/1/salaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Employee profile for id 1
GET {{EmployeeApi_HostAddress}}/api/Employee/1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Employee leaves for id 1
GET {{EmployeeApi_HostAddress}}/api/Employee/1/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
